<section class="page" id="page-game-claims">
          <div class="page-toolbar"><div><span class="section-kicker">SAFE CHAT CLAIMS</span><h2>内置管理</h2><p>只读审计聊天采集、领取命令解析和礼包订单处理结果。</p></div><button class="btn secondary" id="reloadGameClaims" type="button">↻ 刷新</button></div>
          <div class="game-claim-stats">
            <article class="stat-card game-claim-collector"><div class="game-claim-stat-label"><span>采集器状态</span><i></i></div><strong id="chatCollectorState">--</strong><small id="chatCollectorDetail">启用 -- / 运行 -- / 目录 --</small><small>最近处理：<b id="chatLastProcessed">--</b><em>文件数：<b id="chatFilesSeen">--</b></em></small></article>
            <form class="stat-card game-log-settings-card" id="gameLogSettingsForm"><div class="game-log-settings-head"><span>日志巡查设置</span><label class="switch"><input name="logsEnabled" type="checkbox"><span></span></label></div><div class="game-log-settings-fields"><label><input name="logsPollSeconds" type="number" min="1" max="300" required><small>巡查间隔（秒）</small></label><label><input name="logsRetentionDays" type="number" min="1" max="3650" required><small>保留天数</small></label></div><button class="btn primary" type="submit">保存</button></form>
            <article class="stat-card game-claim-metric"><span>解析数量</span><strong id="chatEventsStored">--</strong><small>安全结构化事件</small></article>
            <article class="stat-card game-claim-metric command"><span>触发命令</span><strong id="chatCommandsSeen">--</strong><small>已识别内置命令</small></article>
            <article class="stat-card game-claim-result"><span>触发结果</span><div><strong><b id="chatClaimsSucceeded">--</b><small>成功</small></strong><strong><b id="chatClaimsFailed">--</b><small>失败</small></strong></div><small id="chatTriggerResultHint">仅统计当前前缀</small></article>
            <article class="stat-card game-claim-prefix-card"><span>前缀设置</span><form id="claimPrefixForm" class="game-claim-prefix-form"><label><input name="claimPrefix" maxlength="20" autocomplete="off" placeholder="例如：@" required></label><div class="game-claim-prefix-preview"><code id="claimPrefixPreview">@领取1</code><small>领取命令预览</small></div><button class="btn primary" type="submit">保存</button></form></article>
          </div>
          <div class="game-claims-notice"><span>安全规则</span><p>世界、本地、小队和管理频道中的已确认命令格式均生效；未知格式不会猜测或执行。</p></div>
          <form class="card form-card delivery-notification-card" id="deliveryNotificationForm"><div class="card-head"><div><h3>发货通知</h3><p>点击参数可插入消息模板；已有业务数据直接写入，暂无数据的参数显示“--”。</p></div><label class="switch"><input name="notifyOnSuccess" type="checkbox"><span></span>启用通知</label></div><div class="form-grid cols-3"><label class="span-3">游戏内发货名称<input name="deliveryName" maxlength="50" placeholder="例如：小C发货助理"><span class="field-hint">通知显示为“名称：消息正文”，留空不显示名称。</span></label><label class="span-3">统一通知模板<textarea name="notificationMessage" data-notification-template maxlength="500" placeholder="[玩家昵称]的【{orderName}】"></textarea><span class="field-hint">只设置玩家和物品显示内容；购买、礼包、回收、单件取出和一键取出动作由系统自动追加。</span></label><div class="notification-parameter-helper span-3" id="notificationParameterHelper"></div></div><div class="form-actions"><button class="btn primary" type="submit">保存发货通知</button></div></form>
          <section class="card game-qa-card"><div class="card-head"><div><span class="game-claims-card-kicker">TRIGGERED RESPONSE</span><h3>问答模式</h3><p>玩家发送精确触发词后，商城向该玩家定向回复配置内容。</p></div><div class="game-qa-head-actions"><label class="switch"><input id="gameQaEnabled" type="checkbox"><span></span>启用</label><button class="btn primary" id="addGameQaRule" type="button">＋ 添加规则</button></div></div><div class="game-qa-table"><table><thead><tr><th>触发词</th><th>回复词</th><th>价格</th><th>限制</th><th>执行数据</th><th>最近时间</th><th>状态</th><th>操作</th></tr></thead><tbody id="gameQaRows"><tr><td colspan="8" class="empty loading">正在加载问答规则...</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
        </section>

        
